                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Baker.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-14"><hi rendition="#italic">March 14,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Did Great Britain land troops under asserted right of sovereignty or only for
                    protection? Prompt answer desired.</p>
            </div>
